Transcription
-------------

The machine-readable transcription the script reads is Open5e's
(https://github.com/open5e/open5e-api, data/v2/wizards-of-the-coast/srd-2024/), at the
commit named in apps/TakeInitiative.Api/Reference/Srd52/source.json. Thanks to the
Open5e project. Only the SRD's text and numbers are taken from it: none of Open5e's code,
identifiers or artwork is included in TakeInitiative.
